sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest
    participant PWA as Mobile PWA
    participant CloudDB as Cloud DB
    participant App as Desktop App (Reception)
    participant LLM as Gemini AI
    participant LocalDB as SQLite DB
    participant Housekeeping

    Note over Guest, CloudDB: Booking Phase
    Guest->>PWA: Searches for Room
    PWA->>CloudDB: Checks Availability (Synced)
    PWA->>Guest: Shows Available Rooms
    Guest->>PWA: Books Room
    PWA->>CloudDB: Creates Booking Record

    Note over App, LocalDB: Sync Phase
    App->>CloudDB: Polls for New Bookings
    CloudDB-->>App: Returns New Booking Data
    App->>LocalDB: Saves Booking to Local DB

    Note over Guest, App: Check-in Phase
    Guest->>App: Arrives at Reception / Kiosk
    App->>App: Scans ID / Passport
    App->>LLM: Extract Details from ID Image
    LLM-->>App: Returns JSON (Name, DOB, Address)
    App->>App: Auto-fills Check-in Form
    App->>LocalDB: Updates Room Status to "Occupied"
    App->>Guest: Issues Key Card

    Note over Guest, Housekeeping: Stay & Checkout
    Guest->>App: Requests Checkout
    App->>LocalDB: Calculates Bill (Room + Services)
    App->>Guest: Prints Invoice
    App->>LocalDB: Updates Room Status to "Dirty"
    App->>Housekeeping: Notifies "Room 101 Needs Cleaning"
    Housekeeping->>App: Marks Room "Clean" (after cleaning)
    App->>LocalDB: Updates Room Status to "Available"
